      "writtenOn": "2026-08-12T00:19:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is how [`std::hypot`](https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/numeric/math/hypot) works:\n\u003e if one of the arguments is ±∞, `std::hypot(x, y)` returns +∞ even if the other argument is NaN",
